Overlay patch 0008 (rev9): cadence probe with wall/eng/gpu split,
aud_min/aud_max (0024's atomics; 0 = underrun, the fuzzy-audio instrument;
-1 = audio thread not yet running), load_ms/loads (0025 rev2 aggregate of
synchronous resource-load time), and rev7's addition up_ms/ups (0021 rev3
aggregate of UploadTexture CPU time — the round-3 stutter instrument and
the Vision Pro 4K-ladder metric). Coupled to 0021/0024/0025 by design; the
series applies atomically. __IOS__-only.

